msgid "Discord Rich Presence"
msgstr "Discord Rich Presence"

msgid "Enable Discord Rich Presence at runtime"
msgstr "Activar Discord Rich Presence pendent l’execucion"

msgid "It is time to ditch other radios. Stream and metadata provided by LISTEN.moe."
msgstr "Es lo moment de abandonar d'autras ràdios. Flux e metadonadas provesidas per LISTEN.moe."

msgid "J-POP and K-POP radio"
msgstr "Ràdio J-POP e K-POP"

msgid "Listen to J-POP and K-POP"
msgstr "Escotar J-POP e K-POP"

msgid "Pause and resume the live stream"
msgstr "Pausar e reprene la difusion en dirècte"

msgid "Animated sound bars that react to the music"
msgstr "Barras sonoras animadas que reaccionan a la musica"

msgid "Dynamic colors based on the current album or artist cover"
msgstr "Colors dinamicas segon la cobèrta de l’album o l’imatge de l’artista actual"

msgid "No ads"
msgstr "Pas d'anóncias"

msgid "Initial release."
msgstr "Version iniciala."

msgid "When connected and there is no album or artist image"
msgstr "Quand la connexion es establida e que manca l’imatge de l’album o de l’artista"

msgid "Colored window when connected"
msgstr "Fenèstra colorada quand es connectat"

msgid "AI translation (GPT-5.2); reviewed by nobody"
msgstr "Machine translation (Google Translate, edited with Codex); not human-reviewed"

msgid "This release focuses on visuals and localization."
msgstr "Aquesta version se centra suls visuals e la localizacion."

msgid "Fine-tuned dark/light mode detection so light colors are no longer mistaken for dark ones."
msgstr "Deteccion del mòde escur/clar afinada per confondre pas mai las colors claras amb las escuras."

msgid "Polished translations and improved how they are applied."
msgstr "Traduccions polidas e melhoradas cossí son aplicadas."

msgid "Removed gaps between sound bars."
msgstr "Espacis entre las barras sonoras suprimits."

msgid "Streaming logic now better handles connection issues and stream changes."
msgstr "La logica de flux gestiona ara melhor los problèmas de connexion e los cambiaments de flux."

msgid "Clarified the application description."
msgstr "Esclarzit la descripcion de l'aplicacion."

msgid "Translated image captions"
msgstr "Legendas d'imatges reviradas"

msgid "Updated screenshots to use a more reasonable window size"
msgstr "Las capturas d'ecran mesas a jorn per utilizar una talha de fenèstra mai rasonabla"

msgid "Updated application icon"
msgstr "Icòna d'aplicacion mesa a jorn"

msgid "Display the application icon in media controls."
msgstr "Afichar l'icòna de l'aplicacion dins los contraròtles mèdias."

msgid "Optional Discord activity sharing"
msgstr "Partatge opcional de l’activitat sus Discord"

msgid "Added Discord activity sharing."
msgstr "Ajustat lo partatge d'activitats de Discord."

msgid "Reconnect to Discord instead of disabling this feature."
msgstr "Reconnexion a Discord al luòc de desactivar aquesta foncionalitat."

msgid "Added flags to control pause behavior, autoplay, or disable Discord integration."
msgstr "Apondut de senhals per contrarotlar lo comportament de pausa, la reproduccion automatica o desactivar l'integracion de Discord."

msgid "Fixed an issue where paused playback resumed during a network disruption."
msgstr "Corregit un problèma ont la lectura en pausa repreniá pendent una perturbacion de la ret."

msgid "Added preferences and keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "Las preferéncias e los acorchis de clavièr aponduts."

msgid "Changed pause, resume, and station switching behavior."
msgstr "Comportament de pausa, de represa e de commutacion d'estacion cambiat."

msgid "Added startup options for pause/resume or stop behavior, with play/stop now the default."
msgstr "D'opcions d'aviada apondudas pel comportament de pausa/reprene o d'arrèst, amb legir/arrèst ara per defaut."

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Cercar de mesas a jorn"

msgid "Cancel update"
msgstr "Anullar la mesa a jorn"

msgid "Couldn't check for updates"
msgstr "Poguèt pas verificar las mesas a jorn"

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Tornatz ensajar mai tard."

msgid "Already up to date"
msgstr "Ja a jorn"

msgid "You have the latest version of Listen Moe."
msgstr "Avètz la darrièra version de Listen Moe."

msgid "The release metadata is missing a valid SHA-256 digest."
msgstr "Las metadonadas de version mancan un digest SHA-256 valid."

msgid "Couldn't download the update"
msgstr "Poguèt pas telecargar la mesa a jorn"

msgid "Update canceled"
msgstr "Mesa a jorn anullada"

msgid "The update was canceled."
msgstr "La mesa a jorn es estada anullada."

msgid "The update check was canceled."
msgstr "La verificacion de la mesa a jorn es estada anullada."

msgid "The downloaded installer will not be installed."
msgstr "L'installador telecargat serà pas installat."

msgid "Installing update"
msgstr "Installacion de la mesa a jorn"

msgid "Listen Moe will close."
msgstr "Listen Moe se barrarà."

msgid "Couldn't install the update"
msgstr "Poguèt pas installar la mesa a jorn"

msgid "Checking for updates"
msgstr "Verificacion de las mesas a jorn"

msgid "Downloading update"
msgstr "Mesa a jorn en telecargament"

msgid "Update ready"
msgstr "Mesa a jorn prèsta"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Version"

msgid "Downloaded"
msgstr "Telecargat"

msgid "Looking for a newer Windows installer on GitHub Releases."
msgstr "Recèrca d’un installador mai recent per Windows sus GitHub Releases."

msgid "A newer Windows release is available."
msgstr "Una version mai recenta de l’aplicacion per Windows es disponibla."

msgid "The installer is ready to run."
msgstr "L'installador es prèst a s'executar."

msgid "Couldn't start the installer."
msgstr "Poguèt pas aviar l'installador."

msgid "Removed pause/resume from stable builds."
msgstr "La pausa/represa suprimida de las versions establas."

msgid "Separate experimental features from stable features."
msgstr "Separar las caracteristicas experimentalas de las caracteristicas establas."

msgid "Volume control added."
msgstr "Contraròtle de volum apondut."

msgid "Karaoke"
msgstr "Karaoke"

msgid "Show karaoke"
msgstr "Mostrar lo karaoke"

msgid "Finding lyrics…"
msgstr "Recèrca de las paraulas…"

msgid "Just a moment"
msgstr "Sonque un moment"

msgid "No synchronized lyrics"
msgstr "Pas de tèxte sincronizat"

msgid "This song can still be your tiny concert."
msgstr "Aquesta cançon pòt encara èsser vòstre pichon concèrt."

msgid "Couldn't load lyrics"
msgstr "Poguèt pas cargar las paraulas"

msgid "Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Tornatz ensajar dins un moment."

msgid "Lyrics by LRCLIB"
msgstr "Paraulas provesidas per LRCLIB"

msgid "Added lyrics."
msgstr "Paraulas apondudas."

msgid "Added a song progress bar."
msgstr "Ajustat una barra de progrès de la cançon."

msgid "Long artist and song names scroll smoothly."
msgstr "Los noms d'artistas e de cançons longs se desplaçan doçament."

msgid "Hover over the title to see the full text."
msgstr "Passatz lo cursor sul títol per veire lo tèxte complet."

msgid "Scrolling text and background animations respect Reduce Motion."
msgstr "Lo tèxte desfilant e las animacions de fons respectan l’opcion de reduccion del movement."
